# Strict allowlist for Docker and Azure CLI's local ACR context packer.
# Terraform state, credentials, tools, docs, VCS data, and web assets stay out.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src
!src/**
!migrations
!migrations/**
!fixtures
!fixtures/**

# Re-exclude generated or sensitive files nested under allowed source trees.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
